# LeakSanitizer suppressions for dwmc-debug: leaks entirely inside the X
# libraries. Never suppress a frame of dwmc itself.
#
# fontconfig's global configuration, which XftInit() loads on the first
# XftFontMatch() and nothing frees (dwm does not call FcFini() either). The
# frame is only seen with full unwinding: run with
# ASAN_OPTIONS=fast_unwind_on_malloc=0.
leak:FcInitLoadConfigAndFonts
